WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.400
This is PrepIt.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.500
Your nutritionist, always on.

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:12.600
Open the app and your day is right there: energy, satiety and mood, worked out from what you actually ate.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.200
Tap Ask Nutritionist and just tell it what you had.

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:19.000
"A handful of cucumber slices."

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:21.800
Done, logged to the right time.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.100
Your log fills in through the day, every meal with its calories, protein, carbs and fat.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:30.300
Not sure what to have for dinner? Ask.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:37.400
It knows your targets, and it'll suggest something that fits. Tap Log it, and it's in.

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:44.000
No barcodes. No guessing. Just a nutritionist in your pocket who knows what you've eaten.

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:47.600
PrepIt. Try it free for seven days.
